 id="MidCapFund"><span class="style-module-scss-module__h0M7Qq__title">HDFC </span>Mid Cap Fund</h1><p class="style-module-scss-module__h0M7Qq__fundcategory">Equity</p><div class="style-module-scss-module__h0M7Qq__toggledivoverview my-2"><div class="form-check style-module-scss-module__h0M7Qq__form-switch p-0 d-md-flex justify-content-end align-items-center"><label for="flexSwitchCheckDefault1" class="style-module-scss-module__h0M7Qq__form-check-label">DIRECT</label><a href="/explore/mutual-funds/hdfc-mid-cap-fund/regular"><input class="style-module-scss-module__h0M7Qq__form-check-input undefined" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="flexSwitchCheckDefault1" aria-label="Toggle between Direct and Regular plan"/></a><label for="flexSwitchCheckDefault1" class="style-module-scss-module__h0M7Qq__form-check-label">REGULAR</label></div></div></div></div><div class="style-module-scss-module__h0M7Qq__bannercontent"><h2 class="style-module-scss-module__h0M7Qq__maintitle">About HDFC <!-- -->Mid Cap Fund</h2><div><div class="drupal"><p>An open ended equity scheme predominantly investing in mid cap stocks.</p>

<p>The Scheme shall follow a predominantly Mid cap strategy with a minimum exposure of 65% to Mid-Cap stocks. The Scheme may also seek participation in other equity and equity related securities to achieve optimal portfolio construction.</p>

<p>The aim of equity strategy will be to predominantly build a portfolio of mid-cap companies which have:<br />
a) reasonable growth prospects<br />
b) sound financial strength<br />
c) sustainable business models<br />
d) acceptable valuation that offers potential for capital appreciation.<br />
&nbsp;</p>
